OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatches of   
OL,6,Frain throughout the night, mostly      
OL,7,Flight but with occasional heavier      
OL,8,Fbursts for some. A band of heavy rain  
OL,9,Fand gusty winds approaching the far    
OL,10,Fwest by dawn. Feeling chilly           
OL,11,Fovernight, especially along exposed    
OL,12,Fsouthern coasts.                       
OL,14,CTuesday:FRain, often heavy and with    
OL,15,Fstrong gusty winds, stalls across      
OL,16,Fparts of Cornwall and the Isles of     
OL,17,FScilly, potentially bringing flooding  
OL,18,Fand travel disruption. Dry, cold and   
OL,19,Fbreezy further east.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
