OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:       
OL,6,FPatches of rain on Wednesday morning   
OL,7,Fwith a few bright spells later. Cloud  
OL,8,Fclearing into Thursday with bright and 
OL,9,Fdry conditions. Friday sees further    
OL,10,Fbands of rain and winds increasing.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
